OL,3,CHuge fundraiser to help West Midlands
OL,4,Cfamilies left homeless by fires
OL,6,FA huge fundraiser has been launched to
OL,7,Fhelp families in the West Midlands
OL,8,Fwhose homes were destroyed in fires
OL,9,Facross the region.
OL,11,FDozens of people were injured in fires
OL,12,Fwhich wreaked havoc in the region on
OL,13,Fthe hottest day of the year so far on
OL,14,FThursday, August 13.
OL,16,FFirefighters battled huge infernos in
OL,17,FStourbridge, Highter's Heath, Oldbury,
OL,18,FCastle Vale and Kings Norton to name a
OL,19,Ffew.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/5
