OL,3,CHuge fundraiser to help West Midlands
OL,4,Cfamilies left homeless by fires
OL,6,FMany families, who watched their homes
OL,7,Fburn down, have been left with nothing
OL,8,Fbut the clothes on their back.
OL,10,FAndrew Reynolds, in Highter's Heath,
OL,11,Fwhere a row of six homes were
OL,12,Fdestroyed, said his mum had "lost
OL,13,Feverything".
OL,15,FHe watched his childhood home of 30
OL,16,Fyears go up in flames, sadly powerless
OL,17,Fto do anything to stop it.
OL,19,F"Everything's gone," he said. "It's
OL,20,Fall gone. My mum's lost everything."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
