OL,3,CHuge fundraiser to help West Midlands
OL,4,Cfamilies left homeless by fires
OL,6,FA GoFundMe has been set up by Heart of
OL,7,FEngland Community Foundation in a bid
OL,8,Fto concentrate fundraising efforts for
OL,9,Ffamilies affected by the fires.
OL,11,FThe charity said: "Homes have been
OL,12,Fdestroyed, families have been forced
OL,13,Fto evacuate, and entire neighbourhoods
OL,14,Fhave been left reeling from the impact.
OL,16,F"We're launching this emergency appeal
OL,17,Fto ensure those impacted do not face
OL,18,Fthat recovery alone.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
