CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786808882
OL,3,CHuge fundraiser to help West Midlands
OL,4,Cfamilies left homeless by fires
OL,6,F"Every pound donated to this appeal
OL,7,Fwill go towards supporting families
OL,8,Fand individuals affected by these
OL,9,Fdevastating fires.
OL,11,F"Funds will help provide emergency
OL,12,Fliving expenses, essential household
OL,13,Fitems and clothing, support to replace
OL,14,Fbelongings lost in the fires,
OL,15,Fpractical assistance as families begin
OL,16,Fto rebuild their lives and grants to
OL,17,Faddress immediate and longer-term
OL,18,Frecovery needs.
OL,20,F"Together, we can help them take the
OL,21,Ffirst steps towards recovery."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/5
